[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Penny's Bag]
[00:00.62]Lesson 41 | 第41课
[00:02.56]Penny's bag | 彭妮的包
[00:05.00]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.06]Who is the tin of tobacco for? | 这听烟丝是给谁的？
[00:16.52]Is that bag heavy, Penny? | 彭妮，那个包重吗？
[00:20.66]Not very. | 不太重。
[00:22.66]Here! | 好了！
[00:23.98]Put it on this chair. | 把它放在这把椅子上吧。
[00:26.58]What's in it? | 里面是什么？
[00:28.90]A piece of cheese. | 一块奶酪，
[00:31.64]A loaf of bread. | 一条面包，
[00:34.29]A bar of soap. | 一块肥皂，
[00:37.11]A bar of chocolate. | 一块巧克力，
[00:39.63]A bottle of milk. | 一瓶牛奶，
[00:42.30]A pound of sugar. | 一磅糖，
[00:45.14]Half a pound of coffee. | 半磅咖啡，
[00:48.60]A quarter of a pound of tea. | 四分之一磅茶叶，
[00:52.54]And a tin of tobacco. | 和一听烟丝。
[00:56.72]Is that tin of tobacco for me? | 那听烟丝是给我的吗？
[01:01.47]Well, it's certainly not for me! | 嗯，那当然不是给我的！